        <note xml:id="W-3.8-note-2" n="2" type="observation" target="#W-3.8-l2" resp="#W-3.8-reviewer">The two-line opening capital displaces verse 2 farther right than the ordinary inset. An additional horizontal space of three characters approximates this observed layout.</note>
